@HrmsApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Login as Admin
# @name adminLogin
POST {{HrmsApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@hrms.com",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}

### 2. Login as Manager
# @name managerLogin
POST {{HrmsApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "manager@hrms.com",
  "password": "Manager@123"
}

### 3. Login as Employee
# @name employeeLogin
POST {{HrmsApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "employee@hrms.com",
  "password": "Employee@123"
}

### Store Token Variables (Replace with actual JWT token from login response)
@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.token}}
@managerToken = {{managerLogin.response.body.token}}
@employeeToken = {{employeeLogin.response.body.token}}

### 4. Get Current User Profile (Me)
GET {{HrmsApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 5. Get Leave Balance (Includes pendingDays and availableToRequest)
GET {{HrmsApi_HostAddress}}/api/leave/balance
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}

### 6. Apply for Leave (Weekend Spanning: Fri to Mon = 2 business days)
POST {{HrmsApi_HostAddress}}/api/leave
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "leaveType": "Casual",
  "startDate": "2026-11-20",
  "endDate": "2026-11-23",
  "reason": "Family weekend trip"
}

### 7. Get All Leave Requests
GET {{HrmsApi_HostAddress}}/api/leave
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

### 8. Approve Leave with Manager Comment
PUT {{HrmsApi_HostAddress}}/api/leave/1/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "comment": "Approved. Please ensure handoff is complete."
}

### 9. Reject Leave with Manager Comment
PUT {{HrmsApi_HostAddress}}/api/leave/2/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "comment": "Critical sprint deadline during these dates."
}

### 10. List Employees (Admin)
GET {{HrmsApi_HostAddress}}/api/employees
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 11. Create New Employee (with AnnualAllocation = 24 default)
POST {{HrmsApi_HostAddress}}/api/employees
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Dev Sharma",
  "email": "dev.sharma@hrms.com",
  "password": "Password@123",
  "role": "Employee",
  "department": "Engineering",
  "position": "Backend Developer",
  "joiningDate": "2026-10-15",
  "salary": 1800000.00,
  "managerID": 2
}

### 12. Deactivate Employee with ExitReason
PATCH {{HrmsApi_HostAddress}}/api/employees/8/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Inactive",
  "exitReason": "Relocation to higher studies abroad"
}

### 13. Hardening Test: Deactivate Employee with Active Direct Reports (Expects 409 Conflict)
PATCH {{HrmsApi_HostAddress}}/api/employees/2/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Inactive",
  "exitReason": "Attempt to deactivate manager with reports"
}

### 14. Hardening Test: Deactivate Last Active Admin (Expects 409 Conflict)
PATCH {{HrmsApi_HostAddress}}/api/employees/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Inactive",
  "exitReason": "Attempt to deactivate last admin"
}

### 15. Employee Portal Summary
GET {{HrmsApi_HostAddress}}/api/portal/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}

### 16. Today's Attendance State
GET {{HrmsApi_HostAddress}}/api/attendance/today
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}

### 17. Perform Web Check-In
POST {{HrmsApi_HostAddress}}/api/attendance/check-in
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}

### 18. Perform Web Check-Out
POST {{HrmsApi_HostAddress}}/api/attendance/check-out
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}

### 19. My Monthly Attendance Calendar
GET {{HrmsApi_HostAddress}}/api/attendance/my?month=2026-10
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}

### 20. Team Daily Attendance (Manager / Admin)
GET {{HrmsApi_HostAddress}}/api/attendance/team?date=2026-10-09
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

### 21. Request Attendance Regularization
POST {{HrmsApi_HostAddress}}/api/attendance/regularizations
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workDate": "2026-10-08",
  "requestedCheckIn": "2026-10-08T09:30:00",
  "requestedCheckOut": "2026-10-08T18:30:00",
  "reason": "Biometric terminal network failure"
}

### 22. Get Regularizations List
GET {{HrmsApi_HostAddress}}/api/attendance/regularizations
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}

### 23. Approve Regularization (Manager)
PUT {{HrmsApi_HostAddress}}/api/attendance/regularizations/2/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "comment": "Approved after biometric cross-check"
}

### 24. Leave Calendar View (Manager / Admin)
GET {{HrmsApi_HostAddress}}/api/leave/calendar?month=2026-10
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

### 25. List All Assets (Admin)
GET {{HrmsApi_HostAddress}}/api/assets
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 26. Create New Asset (Admin)
POST {{HrmsApi_HostAddress}}/api/assets
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assetTag": "AST-2026-099",
  "name": "MacBook Pro 16 M3 Max",
  "category": "Laptop",
  "serialNumber": "C02XYZ123456",
  "purchaseDate": "2026-02-15"
}

### 27. Assign Asset to Employee (Admin)
POST {{HrmsApi_HostAddress}}/api/assets/1/assign
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeID": 3
}

### 28. Get My Assigned Assets (Employee)
GET {{HrmsApi_HostAddress}}/api/assets/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}

### 29. Raise Asset Repair Request (Employee)
POST {{HrmsApi_HostAddress}}/api/assets/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assetID": 1,
  "requestType": "Repair",
  "description": "Battery drains rapidly and keyboard key sticking"
}

### 30. Get Asset Requests (Admin / Employee)
GET {{HrmsApi_HostAddress}}/api/assets/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 31. Approve Asset Request (Admin)
PUT {{HrmsApi_HostAddress}}/api/assets/requests/1/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "comment": "Approved for vendor maintenance"
}

### 32. Unassign Asset (Admin)
POST {{HrmsApi_HostAddress}}/api/assets/1/unassign
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 33. List Tickets (Employee gets own, Admin gets all)
GET {{HrmsApi_HostAddress}}/api/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}

### 34. Get Ticket by ID with Thread Comments
GET {{HrmsApi_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/1
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}

### 35. Submit New Ticket (Employee)
POST {{HrmsApi_HostAddress}}/api/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "IT",
  "priority": "High",
  "subject": "Dual monitor display flicker on docking station",
  "description": "Connecting via CalDigit Thunderbolt dock causes secondary display to disconnect every 10 minutes."
}

### 36. Add Public Comment (Employee / Admin)
POST {{HrmsApi_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/1/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "body": "Replaced the HDMI cable with a certified DisplayPort 1.4 cable, issue still persists.",
  "isInternal": false
}

### 37. Add Admin Internal Staff Note (Admin Only)
POST {{HrmsApi_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/1/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "body": "Known issue with dock firmware v2.1. Escalated ticket to IT procurement for dock replacement.",
  "isInternal": true
}

### 38. Admin Update Ticket (Status to InProgress, Assign to Admin)
PATCH {{HrmsApi_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "InProgress",
  "assignedTo": 1,
  "priority": "High"
}

### 39. Close Ticket (Employee or Admin)
PUT {{HrmsApi_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/2/close
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}

### 40. Reopen Ticket (Within 7-day window)
PUT {{HrmsApi_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/2/reopen
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}

### 41. Submit Resolution Feedback Rating (Employee, 1-5 Stars)
POST {{HrmsApi_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/2/feedback
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rating": 5,
  "comment": "Quick and courteous resolution by the support team!"
}


